<title>USA: Shaman files for 2.5 mln share offering.</title>
<headline>Shaman files for 2.5 mln share offering.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shaman Pharmaceuticals Inc said Thursday it filed to sell 2.5 million shares of common stock to the public.</p>
<p>The pharmaceuticals company, which extracts drugs from tropical plants, said it will use the proceeds for research and develeopment.</p>
</text>
